# The stm32g0 family smoke TUs are compiled by tools/check_stm32g0.sh
# alone (no CMake project, so no database entry of their own). The STM32G0
# database's TUs lend their flags, so these parse as arm-none-eabi instead
# of inheriting test/'s host fragment. The G071/G031 variants parse as the
# G0B1; the script stays the judge.
CompileFlags:
  CompilationDatabase: ../../build-cmake/stm32g0b1re-release
